# The three alias mechanisms in one world: the ja rows are spelling aliases, `alias watch`
# is a static alias-mask fixture, and the sidecar beside this file is the live overlay that
# only ^name consults. The bare focus and cursor columns survive every overlay lifecycle.
n 5
col cursor bool 0 0 1 0 0
col focus bool 1 0 0 0 1
col health num 50 60 70 80 90
col gold num 10 20 30 40 50
col marked bool 0 0 0 0 0
alias watch 0 1 0 0 0
ja 照準 cursor
ja 注視 focus
ja 体力 health
ja 金 gold
ja 印 marked
ja 見張 watch
